# Vercel: build output and CLI project link.
#
# site/index.html is NOT ignored. It is a copy of inspection-portal.html and
# the only file Vercel serves, so it has to be in the repository for the Git
# integration to deploy anything — deploying from the CLI instead needs
# credentials this machine does not carry. Regenerate it with ./deploy.sh
# (or copy the file by hand) and commit it alongside the source.
public/
.vercel/
